# The generated boards, kept out of a code knowledge graph built with graphify.
# What a board is:
# https://github.com/SpartanLaboratories/.github/blob/main/policy/nomenclature/boards.md
# The hand-written documents under docs/plans/ stay in. Every pattern is
# relative to the checkout's root. This copy is local to the checkout,
# excluded through .git/info/exclude, and never committed.

# The work boards (docs/plans/): an issue or tracking board with its data and
# its script, the repository work board, the org work board, and the live
# view.
/docs/plans/**/dashboard.html
/docs/plans/**/plan.json
/docs/plans/**/plan.js
/docs/plans/index.html
/docs/plans/board.json
/docs/plans/board.js
/docs/plans/org-work-board/index.html
/docs/plans/org-work-board/board.json
/docs/plans/.live/

# The state boards (docs/dashboards/).
/docs/dashboards/
